:09:05+08:00\">00:09</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/tnews365/35811\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">两名意大利公民11月26日在伊朗对科威特的袭击中死亡</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">死者来自德国军工企业莱茵金属有限公司，当时正在科威特的一个防空设施上维护天线。数架伊朗无人机袭击，随后发生剧烈爆炸。\n伊朗尚未就此事表态。\n（CNN）</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/tnews365/35811\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;5ac495c280c7e9d59dee5209bdd5499716813bb36fe039a7c58ae8be2b2db1af&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;两名意大利公民11月26日在伊朗对科威特的袭击中死亡&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/tnews365/35811&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;竹新社&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T00:09:05+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;死者来自德国军工企业莱茵金属有限公司，当时正在科威特的一个防空设施上维护天线。数架伊朗无人机袭击，随后发生剧烈爆炸。\\n伊朗尚未就此事表态。\\n（CNN）&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-27T00:09:05+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2